B $g 1350 125 420 220 $c.rightAgentsHead $c.rightAgentsBody $orange $orange2;B $g 1350 390 420 210 $c.rightModelHead $c.rightModelBody $orange $orange2;B $g 1350 645 420 210 $c.rightKnowledgeHead $c.rightKnowledgeBody $blue $blue2;A $g 1265 580 1350 235 'knowledge';A $g 1265 770 1350 495 'agent';A $g 1265 930 1350 750 'data'
B $g 1810 135 520 285 $c.externalHead $c.externalBody $purple $purple2;B $g 1810 500 520 330 $c.opsHead $c.opsBody $purple $purple2;A $g 1770 270 1810 270 'external';A $g 1770 670 1810 670 'status';A $g 1770 865 1810 865 'feedback'
